</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T10.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_top ltx_border_t"><span id="A2.T10.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">User CoT Prompt (Retrieve)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T10.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A2.T10.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
