</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T10.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T10.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
