<span id="A2.T10.2.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Reason step-by-step and explore the emotion content. Output "Reasoning:" and then your reasoning steps.
After reasoning, output "Response:" followed by the spans, and nothing else.</span>
</span></td></tr>
