</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.36" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.36.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.36.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.36.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- You may only insert <span id="A2.T11.2.36.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**</span> markers.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.37" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.37.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-bottom: 2.15277pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.37.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.37.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Never delete, normalize, split, merge, or alter any original character (letters, apostrophes, punctuation, whitespace).</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.38" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.38.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.38.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">2. <span id="A2.T11.2.38.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Subjective Emotion Only</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.39" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.39.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.39.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.39.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Only highlight spans that reveal the speaker’s internal emotional state or attitude.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.40" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.40.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.40.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.40.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- This includes:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.41" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.41.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.41.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Explicit emotion words</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.42" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.42.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.42.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.42.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Implicit cues/phrases of feeling or reaction</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.43" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.43.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.43.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.43.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Do not mark:</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.44" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.44.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.44.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.44.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Purely factual or descriptive statements</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.45" class="ltx_tr">
