<span id="A2.T11.2.45.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.45.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- Neutral descriptions of events without any sentiment</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.46" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.46.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T11.2.46.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="A2.T11.2.46.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">3. <span id="A2.T11.2.46.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Self-Check</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.47" class="ltx_tr">
