<span id="A2.T11.2.47.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">- After inserting your markers, remove all <span id="A2.T11.2.47.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">**</span> and verify that the remaining text is identical to the input. Retry until it passes.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T11.2.48" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T11.2.48.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
